    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8099" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circĭnus</span></b> , i, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>m..</i> = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκινος</span>, <i>a pair of
